---
import { Social, Affiliates, Button } from '@/components';
---

<footer class="relative bg-raven">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-6 items-center gap-8 xl:grid xl:grid-flow-row xl:grid-cols-3 lg:justify-center">
    <Affiliates />
    <Social />
    <section aria-labelledby="footer-about" class="max-w-md mx-auto">
      <h2 id="footer-about" class="my-5 tracking-[.08em] font-extralight text-2xl text-center lowercase">✨ About 🌙</h2>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-md shadow-lg p-6 text-white/80">
        <p>
          Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Donec nec lobortis ipsum, ac rhoncus ante.
          Nullam auctor mi sit amet enim lacinia viverra. Etiam fringilla sapien ut vehicula molestie.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-6">
          Ut feugiat enim velit, vitae mattis diam tincidunt id. Quisque et enim ut magna venenatis aliquet.
        </p>
        <div class="flex justify-center">
          <Button href="/style-guide/">Find out more</Button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</footer>
